    OTel --> ELK
    Prometheus --> Grafana
    PgAuth --> PgStats
    PgDepartment --> PgStats
    PgTicket --> PgStats
    PgBrigade --> PgStats
    PgDispatch --> PgStats
    PgFile --> PgStats
    PgSLA --> PgStats

    %% Runtime relation
    Docker -. "local runs services and infra" .-> Services
    Docker -. "local runs infra containers" .-> Storage
    Docker -. "local runs Kafka/observability" .-> Messaging
    Kubernetes -. "future deploy target" .-> Services
    Istio -. "future mesh layer" .-> Services
